Description: Fast GNOME client for Jira Cloud
 Ticket Desk shows your Jira Cloud tickets in a native GNOME window. Lists and
 tickets appear instantly from a local cache and refresh in the background, so
 it also works offline. It renders rich descriptions and comments (including
 tables), shows image attachments, and lets you comment and change status.
